+# Wire Format Policy
+
+The project's current recorded decision is to use CBOR (Concise Binary Object Representation) as the wire serialisation format for the serialization layer. It was chosen for its better type safety and its more effective handling of the application schema, which addresses the project's schema-compatibility requirements.
